# DEFICIENCY EMERGENCY LEDGER

ALL ITEMS BELOW THE MARKER ARE 100% UNAUTHORIZED, CRITICALLY UNDONE WORK,
AND 100% BUGS. EACH ENTRY MEANS THE ISSUE OR PULL REQUEST THAT PRODUCED IT
FAILED.

This is the log of last resort for work misrepresented to pass PR gates, work
misrepresented by an agent, or a discovery that an agent was fundamentally
defective. An entry is literally a cry for help from a failing agent. It is
never an accepted risk, authorized descope, backlog, or success with caveats.

The normal state is this notice and marker with no entries below it. Any entry
blocks completion, PR creation, and merge of the work that produced it until
the defect is verified and has a durable, visible remediation owner. Removing
the emergency entry does not resolve the bug or make the failed work successful.

